I failed to renew BreckYunits.com and some lost soul grabbed it and redirected it to a gambling website or some other monstrosity.
 dateline

Ah well, there's infinite domain names to choose from!

And choose I have! Say hello to breck.lol!
 https://breck.lol breck.lol

***

Nowadays I spend most hours building with atoms, not words.

However, I still want to keep blogging a bit.

***

Typing that long github url was annoying.

Breck.lol is shorter and memorable.
 https://breck.lol Breck.lol

It's also laugh out loud funny, at least in name.

***

I might change it again next year, I don't know.

Breck.lol cost me $2.14, including tax.

A little less than 1 penny per day. I am very respectful of capital nowadays, but I can justify that.

***

Scroll sites are so easy to move/rename. So if I change domains again next year, that's easy enough to do.

Thanks to everyone out there who has helped evolve Scroll. I love how simple and timeless it is.

***

Cheers,
Breck
(Founder of breck.lol)

